    "source_spans": [
      {
        "span_id": "p1:d6791b8a98d27bcf28a4be75",
        "start": 1259,
        "end": 1297,
        "text": "1. 在 `src/fcop/project.py` 加一个私有辅助函数：\n"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "p1:0e840a16cef0a33fe83d4eb2",
        "start": 1911,
        "end": 1998,
        "text": "2. `write_task` 里调用为 `_existing_filenames_for_seq(tasks_dir, self.log_dir / \"tasks\")`。\n"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "p1:a2f6fffa2a2d314b28f4a886",
        "start": 1998,
        "end": 2091,
        "text": "3. `write_report` 里调用为 `_existing_filenames_for_seq(reports_dir, self.log_dir / \"reports\")`。\n"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "p1:bb577ebcce31238908c9ec1b",
        "start": 2091,
        "end": 2181,
        "text": "4. `write_issue` 里调用为 `_existing_filenames_for_seq(issues_dir, self.log_dir / \"issues\")`。\n"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "p1:93de58cd6563ad69a606c946",
        "start": 352,
        "end": 362,
        "text": "write_task"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "p1:f11ffe419145ff533f515280",
        "start": 367,
        "end": 379,
        "text": "write_report"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "p1:6c966e95e11a0555e2cd320a",
        "start": 384,
        "end": 395,
        "text": "write_issue"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "p1:96e8c62a1879151899b82cc8",
        "start": 325,
        "end": 326,
        "text": "修"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "p1:572a205de0120cf52b504938",
        "start": 328,
        "end": 347,
        "text": "src/fcop/project.py"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "p1:a699895076426eb3127b8a31",
        "start": 327,
        "end": 401,
        "text": "`src/fcop/project.py` 中 `write_task` / `write_report` / `write_issue` 三个方法"
